Regarding Bob Lazar and S4

"the claims are unsupported, the credentials appear to be fabricated, and the physics is wrong"
Credentials: Does it matter? Was Parson's credentialed prior to creating the Jet Propulsion labratory? Was Einstein educated as a math professor?
Claims: In the film created by project gravitaur; Bob decribes a fairly routine ascention through the ranks to eventually end up at S4. First starting at EG&G. It's not all that abnormal that for enmployees of one company who's contracted to do operations with other government contractors that the workers between them will float around. Get offered roles inside of other deptments within the larger framework of the machine. As for the HOW he ended up there its no mystery. What fascinates me is the description of the physics. Bob described a cylindrical shaped hollow barrel. Made of some kind of metal. When they rotated the barrel 90 degrees it froze time in the room. The flame that was flickering stopped and froze mid-air. A few things that stood out to me: why 90 degrees? thats a vector dot product equation. Thats a perfect 90 degree perpendiucular. That proves math went into its design. Whatever its purpose was.

